      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Duplicate feature request, can be merged with:\n\n- https://vrchat.canny.io/feature-requests/p/world-filter-for-user-rank\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/trust-level-public-instances\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/lock-instance-by-trust-rank\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/group-instance-minimum-trusted-rank\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/rank-gated-instances\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/rank-gated-instances-1\n\n- https://feedback.vrchat.com/feature-requests/p/trust-rank-limits-for-group-instances",
